\[ m = \frac{222 \, \text{g/mol}}{6.022 \times 10^{23} \, \text{molecules/mol}} \approx 3.7 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{kg} \]

Now, substituting the values into the equation:
\[ v = \sqrt{\frac{3 \times 1.380649 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{J/K} \times 298 \, \text{K}}{3.7 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{kg}}} \]
\[ v = \sqrt{\frac{3 \times 1.380649 \times 298}{3.7}} \, \text{m/s} \]
\[ v = \sqrt{\frac{1229.99}{3.7}} \, \text{m/s} \]
\[ v = \sqrt{332.7676} \, \text{m/s} \]
\[ v \approx 18.25 \, \text{m/s} \]

**Answer:**
18.25
